{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unite  three legendary heroes and villains in tactical combat against an Astral army that grows stronger with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/f997c54f33036cfe8e34c8827dc938df.avif?t=1768376788\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/64e62ce6c43233a0d7e9e5924c9e2741.poster.avif?t=1768376788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/64e62ce6c43233a0d7e9e5924c9e2741.webm?t=1768376788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Movement replaces targeting menus, with your champions automatically unleashing a contextual area attack at their destination tile. Movement paths displace other units, arranging the battlefield to avoid enemies or save allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/5c9aaa9d2243d48573c3b64b4a640197.avif?t=1768376788\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/851bbeabbec9ee6d4c3ee5d49936f601.poster.avif?t=1768376788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/851bbeabbec9ee6d4c3ee5d49936f601.webm?t=1768376788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every region poses a unique tactical puzzle of Astrals and their minions. Plan your path carefully, as liberated lands grant rewards, but the Astral army gains the powers of those you\u2019ve defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/37a144fad2cde815a75294df75a2b74f.avif?t=1768376788\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/1f88d05cac6eb151ed0f328f93a58ba7.poster.avif?t=1768376788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/1f88d05cac6eb151ed0f328f93a58ba7.webm?t=1768376788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expand your champions' skillset with summons like Seraph or Reaper, calling upon them once per battle to invoke new mechanics and situational effects. Cast consumable spells to perfect a strategy or as a desperate measure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991790?t=1768376788","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991790?t=1768376788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/c9f258d2fb544432cc51fe09a40ced1b8cc4e093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768376788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto